description	"B1-series Heavy Security Battle Droid

Mass-produced, fragile combatants that carry heavier weaponry.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- DLT-20A Blaster Rifle (3)

^8Attributes:
- 2 Reinforcements
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 10% less knockback given
- 10% more knockback taken
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Assemble (2)

Security battle droids were security droids of the Trade Federation used for the purposes of defense and detection. These droids were characterized by red markings on their shoulders and upper abdomen, which distinguished them from other variants. 

Security droids most commonly worked in squads led by a command battle droid. 

Trade Federation security droids fulfilling their most common role as guards on capital ships carried the standard weapons (E-5 blaster rifles) used by similar models. Some carried heavier weapons however..."